    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169272761?u=216904e59fc878dca16fb27b4b0450d5e5b69120&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds a new section comparing <code class=\"notranslate\">Error.cause</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">SuppressedError</code>, explaining when each API should be used and how they differ in practice. Includes a concise comparison table and concrete examples for both patterns.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Readers may be unsure whether to use <code class=\"notranslate\">Error.cause</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">SuppressedError</code> when handling multiple or related errors. This change clarifies their intended use cases and helps developers choose the correct API based on real-world scenarios.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42130.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3667375208\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42130\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42130/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42130\">#42130</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42714",
            "title": "Compare Error.cause and SuppressedError use cases",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-09T16:39:47.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-09T16:38:25.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "MUSKANNISHAD",
                "url": "https://github.com/MUSKANNISHAD"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 147 adds support for Iterator Sequencing proposal's <code class=\"notranslate\">Iterator.concat()</code> method</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Issue tracker: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3699237890\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42248\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42248/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42248\">#42248</a></li>\n<li>Content PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3789596045\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42671\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42671/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42671\">#42671</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42713",
            "title": "Fx147: Add relnote for iterator sequencing support",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-09T16:11:28.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-09T16:08:10.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dipikabh",
                "url": "https://github.com/dipikabh"
            }
