        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47806934?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Corrected the inheritance information for the <code class=\"notranslate\">Range</code> interface.<br>\nThis change updates it to reflect that <code class=\"notranslate\">Range</code> inherits from the <code class=\"notranslate\">AbstractRange</code> interface.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The previous documentation was inconsistent with the DOM specification and other MDN pages, such as <code class=\"notranslate\">StaticRange</code>.<br>\nFixing this helps readers understand the correct inheritance hierarchy and ensures MDN remains accurate and reliable.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42547.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3764202011\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42547\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42547/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42547\">#42547</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42707",
