        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/AsyncFunction/AsyncFunction\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">AsyncFunction()</code></a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/GeneratorFunction/GeneratorFunction\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">GeneratorFunction()</code></a>, and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/AsyncGeneratorFunction/AsyncGeneratorFunction\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">AsyncGeneratorFunction()</code></a> contructors can execute their arguments as JavaScript.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are subclasses of <code class=\"notranslate\">Function()</code>, which is documented in</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3746186429\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42462\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42462/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42462\">#42462</a> (this PR depends on it)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What this does is:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the three functions to the list of injection sinks</li>\n<li>Add the warning header and a comment to the examples section for each. These link to the <code class=\"notranslate\">Function()</code> security section and exmples.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">IMO this is sufficient.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510273732\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41507/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507\">#41507</a></p>",
