        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432915?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #38238.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2864335854\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38238\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/38238/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38238\">#38238</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It looks like <code class=\"notranslate\">SameSite=Lax</code> will eventually work as well, but not yet: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3588003004\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/issues/3323\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/httpwg/http-extensions/issues/3323/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/issues/3323\">httpwg/http-extensions#3323</a>.</p>",
