        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Clarify the use of the tooltip role and its association with elements. Emphasize the inaccessibility of native tooltips and the importance of visible text.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42676.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3789841764\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42676\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42676/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42676\">#42676</a></p>",
