            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169272761?u=216904e59fc878dca16fb27b4b0450d5e5b69120&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds documentation for WebExtension internationalization files<br>\nby mentioning the <code class=\"notranslate\">_locales/</code> directory in the manifest-related file list<br>\nand introducing a short section explaining its purpose, with a link to<br>\nthe Internationalization guide.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42541.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3763803720\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42541\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42541/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42541\">#42541</a></p>",
