        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update to various details as a consequence of migrating notify-link-clicks-i18n to MV3. Changes include:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>update of all references to <code class=\"notranslate\">extension.getURL</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.getURL</code>. It was noted during the migration that <code class=\"notranslate\">extension.getURL</code> is not a function available to Manifest V3 extensions.</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/7352080/533075108-a2e678a7-4458-4d20-bb5a-d7c5357d5ede.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..NGd_5NxZ2e9O0ctJvLA5aeZEPBoAAIPs657MEUfwEqg\"><img width=\"848\" height=\"71\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/7352080/533075108-a2e678a7-4458-4d20-bb5a-d7c5357d5ede.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..NGd_5NxZ2e9O0ctJvLA5aeZEPBoAAIPs657MEUfwEqg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 71px;\"></a>\n- update of all references to `extension.getBackgroundPage` to `runtime.getBackgroundPage`. During the investigation into `extension.getURL` it was noted that the [Manifest V3 migration guide](https://extensionworkshop.com/documentation/develop/manifest-v3-migration-guide/#developer-preview-changes) (under Event-driven background scripts) includes a step to update this API.\n- as advice was provided (by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/mixedpuppy/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/mixedpuppy\">@mixedpuppy</a>) that support for deprecated APIs was removed from Manifest V3 the documentation was checked for other references to deprecated `extension` methods. None were found, however, the description of `runtime.lastError` as an alias of `extension.lastError` was reversed.\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The migration of notify-link-clicks-i18n to MV3 is  is in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3786799054\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/webextensions-examples/issues/615\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/webextensions-examples/pull/615/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/webextensions-examples/pull/615\">mdn/webextensions-examples#615</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42679",
            "title": "Changes for notify link clicks i18n to mv3",
            "date_modified": "2026-01-07T22:54:35.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-01-07T22:53:05.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
        },
